======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 36 - Idempotency in Distributed Systems
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Non-idempotent `POST /payments` incrementing balance on every invocation.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Idempotent `POST /payments` with `Idempotency-Key` header verified against DB store.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
